{"seq":3,"slug":"security-compliance-scanning","title":"安全合规扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/security-compliance-scanning","wordCount":1186,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全合规扫描\">安全合规扫描</h1><p>基础设施的安全合规不应是季度审计时的手动检查清单——它应该是每次部署管道中的自动化门禁。安全合规扫描将 CIS 基准、SOC 2 控制项、PCI-DSS 要求等合规框架翻译为机器可执行的检查规则，在基础设施代码<em>应用之前</em>就拦截违规配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>合规即代码</strong>：将 CIS/SOC 2/PCI-DSS 等框架翻译为机器可执行的检查规则</li>\n<li><strong>三层架构</strong>：预部署扫描（CI）→ 部署时策略门禁 → 运行时持续审计</li>\n<li><strong>Checkov</strong>：多框架开源 IaC 安全扫描器，1000+ 内置规则</li>\n<li><strong>Prowler</strong>：AWS 特化的运行时安全审计工具</li>\n<li><strong>基线与例外</strong>：用有到期日的例外文件管理已知合规缺口</li>\n<li><strong>持续验证</strong>：在 apply 间隔内持续评估资源配置是否符合规则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"合规即代码的三层架构\">合规即代码的三层架构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>检查对象</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预部署扫描</td>\n<td>CI 管道（plan 阶段）</td>\n<td>IaC 源码 / plan JSON</td>\n<td>Checkov、tfsec、Snyk IaC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署时策略</td>\n<td>Apply 阶段门禁</td>\n<td>资源属性</td>\n<td>OPA/Conftest、Sentinel、CrossGuard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时审计</td>\n<td>持续（定时/事件驱动）</td>\n<td>已部署资源的实际状态</td>\n<td>AWS Config、ScoutSuite、Prowler</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[IaC 代码] --&gt; B[预部署扫描]&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[terraform plan]&#10;    C --&gt; D[策略门禁]&#10;    D --&gt;|通过| E[terraform apply]&#10;    E --&gt; F[运行时审计]&#10;    F --&gt;|违规| G[告警 + 自动修复]&#10;    B --&gt;|违规| H[阻断 PR]&#10;    D --&gt;|违规| I[阻断 apply]\">graph LR\n    A[IaC 代码] --&gt; B[预部署扫描]\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[terraform plan]\n    C --&gt; D[策略门禁]\n    D --&gt;|通过| E[terraform apply]\n    E --&gt; F[运行时审计]\n    F --&gt;|违规| G[告警 + 自动修复]\n    B --&gt;|违规| H[阻断 PR]\n    D --&gt;|违规| I[阻断 apply]</pre><h2 id=\"checkov-多框架-iac-扫描\">Checkov：多框架 IaC 扫描</h2><p>Checkov（Bridgecrew/Palo Alto Networks）是最广泛使用的开源 IaC 安全扫描器，支持 1000+ 内置检查规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 扫描 Terraform 目录&#10;checkov -d ./infrastructure/ --framework terraform&#10;&#10;# 扫描特定 plan 文件&#10;terraform plan -out=tfplan&#10;terraform show -json tfplan &gt; plan.json&#10;checkov -f plan.json --framework terraform_plan&#10;&#10;# 按合规框架过滤&#10;checkov -d . --check-type CIS_AWS&#10;&#10;# 输出 JUnit XML 供 CI 解析&#10;checkov -d . -o junitxml &gt; checkov-results.xml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扫描 Terraform 目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkov</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./infrastructure/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --framework</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> terraform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 扫描特定 plan 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -out=tfplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">terraform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -json</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tfplan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkov</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> plan.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --framework</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> terraform_plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按合规框架过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkov</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check-type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CIS_AWS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出 JUnit XML 供 CI 解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkov</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> junitxml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkov-results.xml</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"checkov-检查规则示例\">Checkov 检查规则示例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则 ID</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>CIS 映射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CKV_AWS_18</td>\n<td>S3 桶必须启用访问日志</td>\n<td>MEDIUM</td>\n<td>CIS 3.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CKV_AWS_19</td>\n<td>S3 桶必须启用服务端加密</td>\n<td>HIGH</td>\n<td>CIS 2.1.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CKV_AWS_23</td>\n<td>安全组不应允许 0.0.0.0/0 入站</td>\n<td>CRITICAL</td>\n<td>CIS 5.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CKV_AWS_145</td>\n<td>RDS 必须启用存储加密</td>\n<td>HIGH</td>\n<td>CIS 2.3.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CKV_AWS_337</td>\n<td>ECR 仓库必须启用镜像扫描</td>\n<td>MEDIUM</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自定义检查规则\">自定义检查规则</h3><p>当内置规则不满足组织特定要求时，可用 Python 编写自定义检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from checkov.terraform.checks.resource.base_resource_check import BaseResourceCheck&#10;from checkov.common.models.enums import CheckResult, CheckCategories&#10;&#10;class RequireCostCenterTag(BaseResourceCheck):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        name = &quot;确保所有资源包含 CostCenter 标签&quot;&#10;        id = &quot;CUSTOM_001&quot;&#10;        supported_resources = [&quot;aws_instance&quot;, &quot;aws_rds_instance&quot;, &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot;]&#10;        categories = [CheckCategories.GENERAL_SECURITY]&#10;        super().__init__(name=name, id=id,&#10;                        categories=categories,&#10;                        supported_resources=supported_resources)&#10;&#10;    def scan_resource_conf(self, conf):&#10;        tags = conf.get(&quot;tags&quot;, [{}])[0]&#10;        if &quot;CostCenter&quot; in tags:&#10;            return CheckResult.PASSED&#10;        return CheckResult.FAILED&#10;&#10;check = RequireCostCenterTag()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checkov.terraform.checks.resource.base_resource_check </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseResourceCheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checkov.common.models.enums </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CheckResult, CheckCategories</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequireCostCenterTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseResourceCheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"确保所有资源包含 CostCenter 标签\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"CUSTOM_001\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        supported_resources </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aws_instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aws_rds_instance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"aws_s3_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        categories </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [CheckCategories.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GENERAL_SECURITY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                        categories</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">categories,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                        supported_resources</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">supported_resources)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> scan_resource_conf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, conf):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conf.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [{}])[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"CostCenter\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tags:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CheckResult.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PASSED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CheckResult.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FAILED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">check </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RequireCostCenterTag()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cis-基准自动化验证\">CIS 基准自动化验证</h2><p>CIS（Center for Internet Security）Benchmarks 是最广泛采用的云安全基准。各云平台的关键控制项映射：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CIS 控制域</th>\n<th>AWS 检查</th>\n<th>Azure 检查</th>\n<th>GCP 检查</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份管理</td>\n<td>IAM 密码策略、MFA</td>\n<td>Azure AD 条件访问</td>\n<td>IAM 角色分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志审计</td>\n<td>CloudTrail 启用</td>\n<td>Activity Log</td>\n<td>Cloud Audit Logs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络安全</td>\n<td>VPC Flow Logs、SG 规则</td>\n<td>NSG 规则、WAF</td>\n<td>VPC 防火墙规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保护</td>\n<td>S3/EBS/RDS 加密</td>\n<td>Storage 加密</td>\n<td>CMEK 密钥管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控告警</td>\n<td>CloudWatch 告警</td>\n<td>Monitor Alerts</td>\n<td>Cloud Monitoring</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prowler-aws-运行时安全审计\">Prowler：AWS 运行时安全审计</h2><p>Prowler 是 AWS 特化的安全审计工具，直接检查已部署资源的实际配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 运行完整 CIS AWS 基准检查&#10;prowler aws --compliance cis_3.0_aws&#10;&#10;# 只检查特定服务&#10;prowler aws -s s3,iam,cloudtrail&#10;&#10;# 输出 HTML 报告&#10;prowler aws --compliance cis_3.0_aws -M html&#10;&#10;# 按严重度过滤&#10;prowler aws --severity critical high\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行完整 CIS AWS 基准检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prowler</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --compliance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cis_3.0_aws</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只检查特定服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prowler</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> s3,iam,cloudtrail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出 HTML 报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prowler</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --compliance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cis_3.0_aws</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -M</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> html</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按严重度过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">prowler</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aws</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --severity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> critical</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> high</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Compliance_{score} = \\frac{N_{pass}}{N_{pass} + N_{fail}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ian</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"合规扫描的-ci-cd-集成策略\">合规扫描的 CI/CD 集成策略</h2><p>不同严重度的违规应有不同的处理策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>CI 行为</th>\n<th>通知</th>\n<th>SLA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CRITICAL</td>\n<td><strong>阻断部署</strong></td>\n<td>即时通知安全团队</td>\n<td>立即修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HIGH</td>\n<td><strong>阻断部署</strong></td>\n<td>通知开发者</td>\n<td>24 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MEDIUM</td>\n<td>警告（不阻断）</td>\n<td>PR 评论</td>\n<td>Sprint 内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LOW</td>\n<td>仅记录</td>\n<td>周报汇总</td>\n<td>下次迭代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"基线与例外管理\">基线与例外管理</h3><p>现实中不可能所有检查都立即通过。使用基线文件记录已知的合规缺口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .checkov.baseline&#10;{&#10;  &#39;failed_checks&#39;:&#10;    [&#10;      {&#10;        &#39;check_id&#39;: &#39;CKV_AWS_18&#39;,&#10;        &#39;resource&#39;: &#39;aws_s3_bucket.legacy_bucket&#39;,&#10;        &#39;reason&#39;: &#39;遗留桶，迁移计划排期 Q3 2026&#39;,&#10;        &#39;expires&#39;: &#39;2026-09-30&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .checkov.baseline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'failed_checks'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'check_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CKV_AWS_18'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'resource'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aws_s3_bucket.legacy_bucket'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'reason'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'遗留桶，迁移计划排期 Q3 2026'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'expires'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-30'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>基线文件的规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个例外必须有到期日期</li>\n<li>到期后自动恢复为阻断</li>\n<li>例外批准需要安全团队 review</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多合规框架的统一报告\">多合规框架的统一报告</h2><p>大型组织通常需要同时满足多个合规框架（CIS + SOC 2 + PCI-DSS）。许多检查项在不同框架间存在映射关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[单一检查规则] --&gt; B[CIS 3.6: S3 访问日志]&#10;    A --&gt; C[SOC 2 CC6.1: 审计追踪]&#10;    A --&gt; D[PCI-DSS 10.1: 审计跟踪]&#10;    E[一次扫描] --&gt; F[多框架合规报告]\">graph TD\n    A[单一检查规则] --&gt; B[CIS 3.6: S3 访问日志]\n    A --&gt; C[SOC 2 CC6.1: 审计追踪]\n    A --&gt; D[PCI-DSS 10.1: 审计跟踪]\n    E[一次扫描] --&gt; F[多框架合规报告]</pre><p>工具如 Checkov、Prowler 支持 <code>--compliance</code> 参数输出特定框架的符合性报告，一次扫描满足多个审计需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全合规扫描的演进方向\">安全合规扫描的演进方向</h2><p>2026 年的趋势是将合规扫描从&quot;事后检查&quot;推向&quot;设计时预防&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>IDE 集成</strong>：在编码阶段实时提示违规（如 VS Code 的 Checkov 插件）</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助修复</strong>：扫描结果附带自动修复建议代码</li>\n<li><strong>持续验证</strong>：HCP Terraform 的 Continuous Validation 在 apply 间隔内持续评估 check 块</li>\n<li><strong>策略即产品</strong>：合规规则作为内部平台产品，通过 OCI 镜像仓库版本化分发</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于策略引擎的测试方法论，参见 <a href=\"../tools-frameworks/policy-testing-opa-sentinel\">策略测试（OPA/Sentinel）</a>。关于容器镜像的安全扫描细节，参见 <a href=\"../tools-frameworks/container-image-testing\">容器镜像测试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>安全合规扫描通过预部署扫描、部署时策略门禁和运行时审计三层架构，将合规验证从季度审计转变为持续自动化门禁。Checkov 等工具提供 1000+ 开箱即用的检查规则映射到主流合规框架，自定义规则覆盖组织特定要求。基线例外机制平衡了安全理想与现实约束，而到期日机制确保例外不会成为永久豁免。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全合规扫描","id":"安全合规扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"合规即代码的三层架构","id":"合规即代码的三层架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Checkov：多框架 IaC 扫描","id":"checkov-多框架-iac-扫描"},{"level":3,"text":"Checkov 检查规则示例","id":"checkov-检查规则示例"},{"level":3,"text":"自定义检查规则","id":"自定义检查规则"},{"level":2,"text":"CIS 基准自动化验证","id":"cis-基准自动化验证"},{"level":2,"text":"Prowler：AWS 运行时安全审计","id":"prowler-aws-运行时安全审计"},{"level":2,"text":"合规扫描的 CI/CD 集成策略","id":"合规扫描的-ci-cd-集成策略"},{"level":3,"text":"基线与例外管理","id":"基线与例外管理"},{"level":2,"text":"多合规框架的统一报告","id":"多合规框架的统一报告"},{"level":2,"text":"安全合规扫描的演进方向","id":"安全合规扫描的演进方向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络连通性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/integration-e2e/network-connectivity-testing"},"next":{"title":"CI/CD 中的基础设施测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/operations/infra-test-in-pipeline"}}